  <content>
  <note class="self-check"><para>A company that sells music downloads is deciding how much to charge customers to download an album. Based on previous sales, the company predicts that if they charge \(x\) dollars for each download, then the number of downloads, in thousands, is \(13-x\).</para>
<para>Which of the following represents the revenue for downloads?</para></note>
